Third-party components used at build or test time (not redistributed here):

  OpenBLAS      -- linked at build time from the shared library shipped
                   inside the SciPy wheel.  BSD 3-Clause.
                   https://github.com/OpenMathLib/OpenBLAS
  LAPACK        -- reference kernels reached through OpenBLAS.  BSD 3-Clause.
  NumPy, SciPy  -- test and experiment harnesses.  BSD 3-Clause.
  mpmath        -- high-precision shadow evaluation in the certificate
                   battery.  BSD 3-Clause.
